{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vindictus: Defying Fate is an action-packed RPG featuring intense combat and thrilling battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/a6cc625ad77feafbcade6d193f0da76c.poster.avif?t=1762938558\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/a6cc625ad77feafbcade6d193f0da76c.webm?t=1762938558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/a6cc625ad77feafbcade6d193f0da76c.mp4?t=1762938558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Hit Counts, Every Action Matters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment can change your destiny.<br>Master perfect dodge, powerful counters, and heavy-hitting strikes to experience unparalleled combat.<br>Explore unique skills and diverse command inputs exclusive to each character, delivering a stylish and fascinating action style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/de33058cf93a4935ca0cf5b589f18018.poster.avif?t=1762938558\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/de33058cf93a4935ca0cf5b589f18018.webm?t=1762938558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/de33058cf93a4935ca0cf5b589f18018.mp4?t=1762938558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Worlds, Memorable Characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into meticulously designed 3D dungeons and beautifully varied landscapes.<br>Showcase your personality with stunning character costumes and expressive gestures that elevate your gaming experience.<br>Fight fiercely, customize freely, and express yourself vividly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Conquer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those bold enough to challenge fate will emerge victorious.<br>In this crucial moment, survival is everything.<br>The battlefield calls. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare for battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814860?t=1762938558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814860?t=1762938558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/e4eeb352fe1b690d93da172c140058cb9362dfcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762938558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/e4eeb352fe1b690d93da172c140058cb9362dfcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762938558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"THIS GAME MAY CONTAIN CONTENT NOT APPROPRIATE FOR ALL AGES,\r\nOR MAY NOT BE APPROPRIATE FOR VIEWING AT WORK."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vindictus: Defying Fate is an action-packed RPG featuring intense combat and thrilling battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814860/extras/a6cc625ad77feafbcade6d193f0da76c.p